click die needed
click humor spleen needed
click die needed
click humor pulmones needed
click die needed
click humor paunch needed
click die needed
click humor hepar needed
click die needed
hold 2
click continue
wait 60
cursor rest
hold 3
click end-turn
wait 120
cursor rest
hold 3
