wait 5
click skill Snap Thrust
wait 5
click fighter enemy
wait 60
cursor rest
hold 3
dice
click humor hepar needed
click die needed
click humor spleen needed
click die needed
click humor pulmones needed
click die needed
click humor paunch needed
click die needed
click humor hepar needed
click die needed
hold 2
click continue
wait 60
cursor rest
hold 3
click end-turn
wait 120
cursor rest
hold 3
# Turn 4: a snap thrust with the short sword (the skill group opens first; it closes again after
# every action). Humors are spent only if the roll is failing.
click skill Short Sword
wait 5
click skill Snap Thrust
wait 5
click fighter enemy
wait 60
cursor rest
hold 3
dice
click humor hepar needed
click die needed
click humor spleen needed
click die needed
click humor pulmones needed
click die needed
click humor paunch needed
click die needed
click humor hepar needed
click die needed
hold 2
click continue
wait 60
cursor rest
hold 3
click end-turn
wait 120
