wait mode LocationInteraction 900
clip end fight_1

# ── The farm: find a job ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# --start-area opens the visit in the Longhouse Hall, where --npc-static keeps the farmer, and
# --observe-only lets the opening observation look at her alone, so her keyword is always there to be
# clicked (`@farmer`, by what it names rather than by the word the model wrote). --npc-affinity makes
# her a distant acquaintance, which asking for work requires. Diligence is a will whose one want is
# request_job: thinking with it finds exactly one way (--job-only leaves the farmhand's post alone on
# offer), and it carries the act out itself.
mark farm
clip farm_arrival
advance 12 900
cursor rest
hold 6
clip end farm_arrival

mark find_job
clip find_job
click keyword @farmer
choose 0
hold 2
choose diligence
advance 12 900
cursor rest
hold 4
click action 0
choose 0
advance 12 900
dice
hold 2
click humor hepar needed
click die needed
click humor spleen needed
click die needed
click humor pulmones needed
click die needed
click humor paunch needed
click die needed
click humor hepar needed
click die needed
hold 2
click continue
advance 20 900
cursor rest
hold 4
# The conversation: answer while it asks. Which reply each mind voices is the model's choice and the
# branches end at depth two or three, so `click option 0 needed` replies only while a reply is offered.
click option 0 needed
advance 12 900
hold 2
click option 0 needed
advance 12 900
hold 2
click option 0 needed
advance 12 900
hold 2
click option 0 needed
advance 12 900
dice
hold 2
click humor hepar needed
click die needed
click humor spleen needed
click die needed
click humor pulmones needed
click die needed
click humor paunch needed
click die needed
click humor hepar needed
click die needed
hold 2
click continue
advance 20 900
cursor rest
hold 4
click button
wait mode Working 120
clip end find_job

