# ── Wear the boots ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# A bought garment goes straight to its place when that place is free: the boots are on the feet
# already. The inventory shows them there, and the purse empty.
mark wear_boots
clip wear_boots
pause
wait 30
click menu Protagonist
wait 30
click tab inventory
wait 10
cursor rest
hold 4
click element leather_boots
wait 5
cursor rest
hold 6
clip end wear_boots

# ── No coins left: the routine that brings us back ──────────────────────────────────────────────────
